{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobjH9FrL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobAX1SDD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob7d00xr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は 夜桜さんちの大作戦 のキャラ\n夜桜二刃ちゃんを意識して高めのツインテール🎀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobGN7CzI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れなさんと目が合う時はどうしても胸がドキドキしちゃって、好きだって実感させられます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobpTRdbh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「いるとウザイしそこにいなきゃ困る」のところ\nまつりさんと向かい合って踊ってるのだけど、怒ってる顔がとっても可愛くてたまに思い出します"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobL7ZJRJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "複数人で自撮りをするのが好きだからたまに無言でカメラを向けます\n何も言わずポーズしてくれます、嬉しい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近のミーグリの写真をすこし💌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobm8xzvY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobM90fWh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob5WehY3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日はガーリーな気分だったので\nさくらんぼ柄のワンピースにしたよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼\n￼\n￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobhjJbc6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobq3qgRS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobOxGWu3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob88N2kz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これはデニムを履きたくなった2日間👖"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobIqhan4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今日はシンプルなお洋服にしたよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は会える約束がたくさんで嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい〜って伝えてくれる姿が愛おしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "顔がほどける瞬間とか\n笑顔になったときとか\n早口で想いを伝えてくれたり\nプロポーズしてくれたり 笑\nたまに涙してくれたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "えーありがとう〜笑 ってつい言っちゃうのは照れ隠しで、\nあとから何回も思い出してる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すごくすごく嬉しく思ってる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もありがとうーーー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobP1y3ac.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またねっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobOIrccT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobJLbUWa.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "♩"}], "source": "official"}